1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 18=

10
00:00:59,990 --> 00:01:01,950
His Majesty has no intention
of killing you either.

11
00:01:02,830 --> 00:01:04,070
He merely ordered me

12
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:06,150
to find a way to erase your memory.

13
00:01:07,390 --> 00:01:08,390
Erase my memory?

14
00:01:10,470 --> 00:01:12,180
His Majesty wants me
to forget everything,

15
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:14,750
forget who she is,

16
00:01:15,150 --> 00:01:16,430
and even forget who I am.

17
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:18,380
Yes.

18
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:23,530
I never knew

19
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:25,590
you could heal not only the body,

20
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:26,850
but the mind as well,
Deputy Director Shen.

21
00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:29,790
You might as well give me a quick death.

22
00:01:30,110 --> 00:01:30,860
After all,

23
00:01:31,150 --> 00:01:33,620
only the dead can keep a secret forever.

24
00:01:34,750 --> 00:01:36,260
I can use golden needles
on your acupoints

25
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:40,110
to return your mind
to that of a child under three.

26
00:01:42,470 --> 00:01:43,710
But I don't wish to do that.

27
00:01:44,470 --> 00:01:45,540
It would be unfair to you.

28
00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:49,150
When has this world
ever been fair to women?

29
00:01:50,250 --> 00:01:51,470
A daughter must obey her father,

30
00:01:51,470 --> 00:01:52,830
and a wife must obey her husband.

31
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:54,750
Did anyone ever ask
if I wanted to marry,

32
00:01:54,750 --> 00:01:55,790
or whom I wanted to marry?

33
00:01:56,900 --> 00:01:59,390
I'm nothing more
than a pawn of the Cui family,

34
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:01,030
at my brother's disposal.

35
00:02:02,230 --> 00:02:03,830
No one cares whether it's fair.

36
00:02:03,950 --> 00:02:05,540
All they care about
is winning or losing.

37
00:02:05,590 --> 00:02:06,310
I care.

38
00:02:07,510 --> 00:02:09,180
You don't have to be anyone's pawn.

39
00:02:09,510 --> 00:02:10,510
You can simply be yourself.

40
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:13,340
Be myself?

41
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:19,870
Before I entered the palace,

42
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:21,780
I dreamed of going to Jiangnan.

43
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:25,590
I imagined that by some little bridge,

44
00:02:26,390 --> 00:02:27,230
down a quiet alley,

45
00:02:28,670 --> 00:02:29,900
or perhaps around a corner,

46
00:02:30,780 --> 00:02:32,470
I'd meet the love of my life.

47
00:02:34,180 --> 00:02:35,230
We would live an ordinary life

48
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:37,030
together in peace and contentment.

49
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:40,750
But now,

50
00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:43,470
I am a Noble Consort appointed
by His Majesty himself.

51
00:02:44,950 --> 00:02:46,260
Going to Jiangnan

52
00:02:49,510 --> 00:02:50,950
is nothing but an impossible dream.

53
00:02:53,670 --> 00:02:54,310
Your Highness,

54
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:56,980
if you wish to live a different life,

55
00:02:57,620 --> 00:02:59,110
I can help make that wish come true.

56
00:03:01,830 --> 00:03:02,420
You?

57
00:03:03,260 --> 00:03:04,110
Trust me.

58
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:17,170
There's someone else
I want to take with me.

59
00:03:30,510 --> 00:03:31,300
Deputy Director Shen,

60
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:33,260
you know Her Highness's temper.

61
00:03:33,570 --> 00:03:35,840
She has never allowed anyone
from the Imperial Medical Service near her.

62
00:03:35,950 --> 00:03:36,790
I'm afraid this time,

63
00:03:37,010 --> 00:03:38,290
she'll send you away
with a scolding again.

64
00:03:38,850 --> 00:03:39,920
We won't know unless we try.

65
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,170
I have to at least give it a chance.

66
00:03:41,630 --> 00:03:42,190
Thank you.

67
00:03:50,910 --> 00:03:51,510
Your Highness.

68
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:54,050
Deputy Director Shen is here with
a verbal message from His Majesty.

69
00:03:55,580 --> 00:03:56,230
His Majesty?

70
00:03:56,830 --> 00:03:58,260
Has His Majesty finally thought of me?

71
00:03:58,670 --> 00:03:59,910
He has something to say to me?

72
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:01,190
Yes, Your Highness.

73
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,640
His Majesty has a message

74
00:04:03,420 --> 00:04:06,260
that he ordered me
to deliver to you personally.

75
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:10,540
Come, sit down and tell me.

76
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:12,420
Sit.

77
00:04:13,630 --> 00:04:15,020
What does His Majesty wish to tell me?

78
00:04:15,980 --> 00:04:16,860
His Majesty said,

79
00:04:18,140 --> 00:04:18,790
"Yuzhen,

80
00:04:20,420 --> 00:04:21,390
your dancing

81
00:04:21,540 --> 00:04:23,670
is the most graceful and captivating
I have ever seen,

82
00:04:24,390 --> 00:04:26,020
and a sight I could never forget."

83
00:04:27,950 --> 00:04:28,860
What else?

84
00:04:29,110 --> 00:04:30,230
His Majesty also said,

85
00:04:30,670 --> 00:04:31,740
"The day I first saw you,

86
00:04:32,300 --> 00:04:33,510
your breathtaking dance

87
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:36,920
drew butterflies to your side,

88
00:04:37,250 --> 00:04:38,610
fluttering and dancing around you.

89
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:40,630
That beautiful sight

90
00:04:42,110 --> 00:04:45,390
remains vivid in my memory even now."

91
00:04:50,420 --> 00:04:51,350
You're lying.

92
00:04:51,790 --> 00:04:53,190
If he truly remembers it so vividly,

93
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:54,740
why didn't His Majesty come to meet me?

94
00:04:54,790 --> 00:04:56,260
Why does he keep avoiding me?

95
00:04:56,350 --> 00:04:57,630
You're deceiving me!

96
00:04:57,950 --> 00:04:58,510
Your Highness,

97
00:04:59,510 --> 00:05:01,300
how much longer
will you keep deceiving yourself?

98
00:05:02,010 --> 00:05:03,690
Your pulse is steady,
and your vitality is strong.

99
00:05:03,690 --> 00:05:05,080
There is nothing wrong with you at all.

100
00:05:08,460 --> 00:05:09,230
Ning.

101
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:10,260
Leave us for now.

102
00:05:11,070 --> 00:05:11,540
Yes.

103
00:05:21,460 --> 00:05:23,070
Whether I'm mad or foolish,

104
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:24,330
ill or perfectly well,

105
00:05:24,330 --> 00:05:25,650
what does it have to do with you?

106
00:05:26,020 --> 00:05:27,390
It's not your place to judge me.

107
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:28,830
Your Highness,

108
00:05:29,550 --> 00:05:30,390
in your heart,

109
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:31,260
is there truly no one

110
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:32,630
but His Majesty?

111
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:35,070
Is there truly nothing else
in life that matters to you?

112
00:05:35,950 --> 00:05:37,220
Your mother outside the palace,

113
00:05:37,770 --> 00:05:39,320
your younger sister
who has yet to marry,

114
00:05:40,430 --> 00:05:41,950
and your elderly grandmother,

115
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:44,290
who is nearing the end of her life
and prays for you every day.

116
00:05:45,020 --> 00:05:46,460
Do none of your own flesh and blood

117
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:49,140
mean anything to you?

118
00:05:50,260 --> 00:05:52,580
Don't think that reading
a few books of the sages

119
00:05:52,580 --> 00:05:54,430
gives you the right to tell me
how to live my life.

120
00:05:55,750 --> 00:05:57,020
Your words

121
00:05:57,460 --> 00:05:58,950
may sound sympathetic,

122
00:05:59,510 --> 00:06:00,700
but they're really like knives

123
00:06:00,750 --> 00:06:01,950
cutting into my heart.

124
00:06:02,220 --> 00:06:03,950
They are of no help to me whatsoever.

125
00:06:04,390 --> 00:06:05,070
Yang Yuzhen,

126
00:06:05,580 --> 00:06:07,900
how much longer
will you keep up this charade?

127
00:06:11,220 --> 00:06:12,070
Cui Rongyin?

128
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,000
What are you doing here?

129
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:17,190
When we first entered the palace,

130
00:06:17,660 --> 00:06:19,070
we fought each other

131
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:20,460
for His Majesty's favor,

132
00:06:20,550 --> 00:06:21,660
using every scheme we could

133
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,650
and stopping at nothing.

134
00:06:23,690 --> 00:06:25,260
Yes, I admit it.

135
00:06:26,140 --> 00:06:27,260
In the end, I won.

136
00:06:28,020 --> 00:06:29,260
But what did it matter?

137
00:06:30,090 --> 00:06:32,020
Now even I
have lost His Majesty's favor.

138
00:06:32,450 --> 00:06:33,290
What makes you think

139
00:06:33,630 --> 00:06:34,830
you'll be any different?

140
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:38,830
The Cui family has fallen.

141
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:41,430
You are no longer
of any use to His Majesty.

142
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:42,950
As you are now,

143
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:45,900
how are you
any different from me, a castoff?

144
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:47,100
You're right.

145
00:06:47,990 --> 00:06:49,560
That's why I, Cui Rongyin,

146
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:51,610
refuse to remain
a bitter woman trapped in this palace.

147
00:06:52,260 --> 00:06:53,950
I refuse to remain a pawn of my family.

148
00:06:55,900 --> 00:06:57,900
I'm leaving this gilded cage.

149
00:06:58,630 --> 00:07:00,070
I want my life back.

150
00:07:01,990 --> 00:07:02,700
Yang Yuzhen,

151
00:07:03,510 --> 00:07:04,870
will you come with me?

152
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,390
Cui Rongyin,

153
00:07:08,990 --> 00:07:10,310
have you lost your mind?

154
00:07:11,550 --> 00:07:13,750
I've never been
more clearheaded than I am now.

155
00:07:14,750 --> 00:07:15,310
Yuzhen,

156
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:17,220
let's leave together.

157
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:18,650
Let's leave the palace together.

158
00:07:18,650 --> 00:07:19,650
Leave His Majesty behind.

159
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:22,390
Just as we were before we married.

160
00:07:40,260 --> 00:07:41,190
Rongyin.

161
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:46,580
Can we really leave this place?

162
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:50,100
Can we truly escape this palace?

163
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:56,830
If Your Highnesses
have made up your minds,

164
00:07:57,220 --> 00:07:58,950
I will do everything in my power

165
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:01,950
to see you both
safely out of the palace.

166
00:08:09,950 --> 00:08:10,550
Your Majesty.

167
00:08:11,490 --> 00:08:13,900
I have developed a drug
that can erase one's memory.

168
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:15,650
Once taken,

169
00:08:15,650 --> 00:08:16,880
all memories of the past will be lost,

170
00:08:17,140 --> 00:08:18,870
leaving the mind
as innocent as a newborn's.

171
00:08:19,580 --> 00:08:21,900
Everything that came before
will fade away.

172
00:08:27,630 --> 00:08:28,460
Have Cui Rongyin

173
00:08:29,830 --> 00:08:31,100
take it at once.

174
00:08:32,580 --> 00:08:33,660
As you command, Your Majesty.

175
00:08:34,260 --> 00:08:35,100
Your Majesty.

176
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:35,990
Your Majesty.

177
00:08:36,300 --> 00:08:36,930
Your Majesty.

178
00:08:37,410 --> 00:08:38,800
Noble Consort Cui
and Noble Consort Yang,

179
00:08:38,870 --> 00:08:40,870
both of them

180
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:42,550
have passed away.

181
00:08:43,430 --> 00:08:44,220
What did you say?

182
00:08:44,460 --> 00:08:45,390
Say that again.

183
00:09:07,660 --> 00:09:08,260
Your Majesty.

184
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:12,070
Neither of them has a pulse.

185
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:14,310
From what I can determine,

186
00:09:14,610 --> 00:09:15,950
they took poison and ended their lives

187
00:09:15,990 --> 00:09:17,070
half an hour ago.

188
00:09:30,950 --> 00:09:31,620
(Your Majesty,)

189
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:34,620
(Rongyin and I entered
the palace one after the other)

190
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:35,920
(and served by Your Majesty's side.)

191
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:38,310
(We once believed ourselves
blessed beyond measure.)

192
00:09:38,850 --> 00:09:40,440
(But in our three years
within the palace,)

193
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,210
(the two of us fought
for Your Majesty's favor,)

194
00:09:42,210 --> 00:09:43,560
(consumed by jealousy and rivalry,)

195
00:09:43,810 --> 00:09:45,370
(until we had worn away
the bond between us.)

196
00:09:45,690 --> 00:09:47,080
(It brought us nothing but misery.)

197
00:09:47,730 --> 00:09:49,210
(Now everything
has finally come to an end.)

198
00:09:49,210 --> 00:09:50,600
(All that once mattered has faded away.)

199
00:09:50,790 --> 00:09:52,550
(At last, we have
made peace with it all)

200
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,530
(and become sisters once more.)

201
00:09:54,850 --> 00:09:56,320
(To journey together into the afterlife)

202
00:09:56,790 --> 00:09:58,100
(is a fitting end for us.)

203
00:09:58,550 --> 00:10:00,100
(We ask for nothing more in this life.)

204
00:10:00,580 --> 00:10:03,380
(We only wish for
trees to grow as trees,)

205
00:10:03,620 --> 00:10:05,150
(and flowers to bloom as flowers.)

206
00:10:05,460 --> 00:10:06,980
(We humbly beg
Your Majesty to show us mercy)

207
00:10:07,340 --> 00:10:10,150
(and allow our remains to return home)

208
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,840
(to be laid to rest
in our ancestral graves.)

209
00:10:12,310 --> 00:10:14,070
(Rongyin and Yuzhen)

210
00:10:14,580 --> 00:10:16,030
(humbly thank
Your Majesty for your grace.)

211
00:10:21,460 --> 00:10:22,460
Deputy Director Shen.

212
00:10:23,860 --> 00:10:27,100
Is there truly no way
to save the two Noble Consorts?

213
00:10:28,090 --> 00:10:29,440
Forgive my inability, Your Majesty.

214
00:10:30,270 --> 00:10:31,790
Their Highnesses
have indeed passed away.

215
00:10:33,380 --> 00:10:35,700
Please accept my condolences,
Your Majesty.

216
00:10:46,340 --> 00:10:47,070
Eunuch Li.

217
00:10:48,580 --> 00:10:49,190
Your Majesty.

218
00:10:50,070 --> 00:10:51,070
Pass down my decree.

219
00:10:52,150 --> 00:10:55,550
Have the coffins of Noble Consort Cui
and Noble Consort Yang

220
00:10:56,700 --> 00:10:58,460
properly escorted
out of the palace together

221
00:10:59,450 --> 00:11:00,930
and returned
to their respective hometowns.

222
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:05,170
They must be given funerals
befitting Noble Consorts

223
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:08,480
and laid to rest
in their families' ancestral graves.

224
00:11:09,280 --> 00:11:10,290
See that it is done without fail.

225
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:14,540
As you command, Your Majesty.

226
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:18,190
Your Majesty.

227
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:22,670
Their Highnesses
showed me great kindness in life.

228
00:11:23,850 --> 00:11:25,170
I remain deeply grateful to them.

229
00:11:25,550 --> 00:11:26,790
I humbly ask Your Majesty

230
00:11:27,830 --> 00:11:30,500
to allow me to escort
their coffins on their final journey

231
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:31,960
as a last gesture of gratitude.

232
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:38,070
Granted.

233
00:11:38,100 --> 00:11:42,180
(Hongyun Gate)

234
00:11:44,010 --> 00:11:45,410
♪You planted warmth♪

235
00:11:45,410 --> 00:11:47,150
♪Then, in the spring♪

236
00:11:47,150 --> 00:11:50,030
(Noble Consort Cui, Noble Consort Yang,)

237
00:11:51,450 --> 00:11:52,560
(The way has been prepared.)

238
00:11:53,550 --> 00:11:55,910
(May you both truly begin anew.)

239
00:12:15,260 --> 00:12:18,120
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

240
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:21,820
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

241
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:25,300
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

242
00:12:26,150 --> 00:12:29,140
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

243
00:12:29,990 --> 00:12:33,310
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

244
00:12:33,650 --> 00:12:36,940
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

245
00:12:37,290 --> 00:12:43,770
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

246
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:51,650
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

247
00:12:54,150 --> 00:13:02,000
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

248
00:13:02,300 --> 00:13:04,110
♪I stand here today♪

249
00:13:04,250 --> 00:13:08,760
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

250
00:13:08,760 --> 00:13:16,250
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

251
00:13:16,890 --> 00:13:18,180
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

252
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:20,580
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

253
00:13:21,020 --> 00:13:27,870
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
